<div class="footer-note">
  <b>Design notes.</b> Eight core pages mapped to the function spec — Home, African Tours, Trip Detail, Booking, Business Cooperation, Partner Application, Order Center, Personal Center — plus shared popups (login sheet, dropdown filter, image/QR preview, clipboard toast). Built on the Tourista brand system: Tourista Blue #1E40AF, Tourista Orange #FF8C42, Inter type, generous white space. WeChat conventions throughout: status bar, native title bar with capsule menu (••• / ○), and a 5-item bottom tab bar (Home · Tours · Cooperate · Orders · Me). All icons are vector SVG (no emoji), touch targets ≥ 44pt, WCAG AA contrast. Content reflects real Tourista context — 7-day Zimbabwe inspection tour, dual-country delegations, AR factory inspection, Vector AGR drones, and the China–Africa trade corridor.
</div>

